    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“The first shape was softer. The second shape remembers.”</em></p><p><strong>The Thing You Were (1/Scene).</strong> As a bonus action, briefly re-surface a trait of your pre-pressure self. Pick one effect; it lasts until the end of your next turn:</p><ul><li><em>Softer</em>: your movement increases by 10 feet and you have advantage on Intrigue checks to squeeze or slip past.</li><li><em>Older</em>: you gain low-light vision 60 feet if you don't already have it, or +30 feet if you do.</li><li><em>Wetter</em>: you become immune to the <em>burning</em> and <em>prone</em> conditions, and difficult terrain does not slow you.</li></ul><p>You cannot pick the same option twice before a Soma Break.</p>",
      "chat": ""
